DECset V12.0 for OpenVMS Systems

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Higher level of integration and consistency

o  Enhancements to DECset components

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

DECset for OpenVMS systems is an integrated software developer's toolset
positioned to address traditional (3GL) programming needs. The DECset tools
fulfill the edit, compile, and test functions in the classical back-end CASE
programming model. The tools in the DECset environment can be used in either
a workstation or character-cell terminal environment. All components include
both a DECwindows Motif and a command line interface. Components include:

o  DEC Code Management System (CMS) -- A file librarian and version
   management system.

o  DEC Language-Sensitive Editor/Source Code Analyzer (LSE/SCA) -- A
   powerful editor with built-in knowledge of supported languages.

o  DEC Module Management System (MMS) -- A software system builder for
   OpenVMS DECset users.

o  DEC Test Manager -- A tool for administering and running program test
   procedures.

o  DEC Performance and Coverage Analyzer (PCA) -- A highly developed tool
   for pinpointing runtime bottlenecks and for determining which segments of
   code have executed during testing time.

DECset V12.0 Features

o  A new graphical interface (called the Environment Manager) for defining
   the execution environment for all DECset tools displaying on a particular
   DECwindows display.

o  Full PCA functionality on OpenVMS Alpha systems for analyzing system
   service calls made by an application.

o  PCA collection and analysis of system service data, including:
   - Entry and exit from system service CPU times.
   - Lost data indication.
   - System service arguments.

o  LSE undo function, providing the user with the capability to rollback some LSE
   functions performed.

o  MMS graphical user interface, allowing the user to utilize MMS build
   capabilities in a DECwindows environment; automatic generation of MMS
   scripts.

BENEFITS

o  DECset software serves as a common toolset for multiple application
   types. It can be used to develop and maintain a broad spectrum of
   applications.

o  A multiplatform product, DECset software provides consistent
   functionality on OpenVMS VAX and Alpha systems to minimize training costs
   and provide flexibility in platform choice.

o  DECset software supports multiple languages, including Ada, BASIC, C,
   COBOL, Fortran, and Pascal. As a result, there is no need to buy
   different programming environments to support development projects in
   different languages.

o  V12.0 features provide improved software development productivity on
   OpenVMS systems, as well as reduced training and improved ease-of-use of
   DECset software.

AVAILABITITY AND ORDERING

DECset V12.0 for OpenVMS Alpha systems (SPD 42.29) is available now through
Digital and its DECdirect service. DECset V12.0 for OpenVMS VAX systems (SPD
27.07) will be available June 16.

