                 Read Data Transfer Rate    Write Data Transfer Rate
Controller       (Megabytes per Second)     (Megabytes per Second)
------------     -----------------------    ------------------------
HSJ30/HSJ40*      6.7                       4.4
HSD30             3.2                       2.8
