The ISL Director

The ISL Director is a shareable image activated by
LIB$FIND_IMAGE_SYMBOL; therefore it need not have transfer
vectors, as long as the two required entry points are declared
UNIVERSAL. These two routines are called in user mode. They are
passed a single parameter, the address of a data structure called
the QENTRY.

The pertinent fields of the QENTRY data structure passed to
RSM$ISL_FETCH are

