*  AlphaGeneration product suitable for the industrial environment
*  Digital UNIX or Windows NT software are pre-installed for immediate
   operation

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The Digital Industrial System represents a low-cost, rackmountable system.
It is an AlphaGeneration product well suited for use in an industrial
environment. The Digital Industrial System brings the power of the Alpha
microprocessor down to the shop floor.

The system is immediately operational with the pre-installation of the
operating system. The Digital Industrial System runs either Microsoft
Windows NT or Digital UNIX software, covering a wide range of industrial
applications.

The Digital Industrial System offers ISA and PCI expansion slots, and
enables the use of very common, low-cost ISA options, and high-performance,
industry standard PCI options.

BENEFITS

*  Alpha power available in an industrial environment.
*  Cost attractive solution for rackmountable system.
*  100 percent utilization of standard software under Windows NT and Digital
   UNIX.
*  100 percent utilization of standard hardware options for ISA and PCI bus.
*  Digital maintenance and support.

