The Digital Industrial System is available now in Europe only.

Different base packages are available depending on:

   - Operating system chosen (Digital UNIX or Windows NT)
   - Type of system chosen (CPU system or complete rackmountable station
     with CPU system, plus monitor and keyboard)
   - Type of keyboard (QWERTY/AZERTY).

The video adapter is included in the CPU system for Windows NT and the
complete system for Digital UNIX. The monitor and keyboard are delivered
