RoamAbout Wireless LAN Packages

Digital is presenting a limited time offer for the 915 MHz RoamAbout
products currently available in North America. RoamAbout network adapters
are available at a 40 percent discount when the RoamAbout Access Point
product is purchased. Also, when four RoamAbout network adapters are
purchased, the fifth one is free.

With the RoamAbout Access Point product (SPD 51.38.01), wireless desktop,
laptop, notebook, or PDA users gain the freedom to roam about
freely--anywhere in a building--while maintaining continuous connections to
a wired Ethernet network. Using the RoamAbout 915 DS/PC Card Network
Adapter, mobile PC users can communicate with each other and access the
wired LAN through the RoamAbout Access Point product. The RoamAbout products
are an award-winning product set delivering outstanding performance in a
wireless environment with the functions of a full-featured filtering and
forwarding bridge. They provide a dynamic solution for dynamic work
environments, temporary offices, difficult wiring environments, and
untethered roaming users.These packages will be available through all normal
networks products business channels in North America.

